{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 15779246126376962542,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Metadata for Python Software Packages",
      "source_hash": 17996915827887478568,
      "context_hash": 17276621436332105427,
      "translation": "Python 소프트웨어 패키지를 위한 메타데이터",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:19.901979Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Introduction",
      "source_hash": 17143975622463353612,
      "context_hash": 6344936716545575772,
      "translation": "서론",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:19.901982Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This PEP describes a mechanism for adding metadata to Python packages.",
      "source_hash": 3598135053096227510,
      "context_hash": 14591581790658290131,
      "translation": "이 PEP는 Python 패키지에 메타데이터를 추가하는 메커니즘을 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:19.901982Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It includes specifics of the field names, and their semantics and usage.",
      "source_hash": 1525954840275318508,
      "context_hash": 7741991243624970801,
      "translation": "여기에는 필드 이름의 세부 사항과 그 의미 및 사용법이 포함됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:19.901982Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Including Metadata in Packages",
      "source_hash": 6142545026947709806,
      "context_hash": 8951273787795125640,
      "translation": "패키지에 메타데이터 포함하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:19.901982Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Distutils 'sdist' command will be modified to extract the metadata fields from the arguments and write them to a file in the generated zipfile or tarball.",
      "source_hash": 13189111992838670377,
      "context_hash": 18109724927910112963,
      "translation": "Distutils의 'sdist' 명령은 인자에서 메타데이터 필드를 추출하여 생성된 zipfile 또는 tarball 내 파일에 기록하도록 수정될 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:19.901983Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This file will be named PKG-INFO and will be placed in the top directory of the source distribution (where the README, INSTALL, and other files usually go).",
      "source_hash": 16293743844116486510,
      "context_hash": 18165005215058650354,
      "translation": "이 파일은 PKG-INFO라는 이름을 가지며, 소스 배포판의 최상위 디렉터리(README, INSTALL 및 기타 파일들이 보통 위치하는 곳)에 놓이게 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:19.901983Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Developers may not provide their own PKG-INFO file.",
      "source_hash": 16396589206063865964,
      "context_hash": 5947000396317977315,
      "translation": "개발자는 자신만의 PKG-INFO 파일을 제공할 수 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:19.901983Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The \"sdist\" command will, if it detects an existing PKG-INFO file, terminate with an appropriate error message.",
      "source_hash": 14817611282382028930,
      "context_hash": 17420710275723770893,
      "translation": "\"sdist\" 명령은 기존 PKG-INFO 파일이 존재하는 것을 감지하면, 적절한 오류 메시지와 함께 종료됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:19.901983Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "This should prevent confusion caused by the PKG-INFO and setup.py files being out of sync.",
      "source_hash": 1233583372443590760,
      "context_hash": 15074231146532320040,
      "translation": "이는 PKG-INFO 파일과 setup.py 파일이 동기화되지 않아 발생하는 혼란을 방지할 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:19.901983Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The PKG-INFO file format is a single set of :rfc:`822` headers parseable by the rfc822.py module.",
      "source_hash": 15381925668748272876,
      "context_hash": 10496267064161293297,
      "translation": "PKG-INFO 파일 형식은 rfc822.py 모듈로 파싱 가능한 단일 :rfc:`822` 헤더 집합입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:19.901984Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The field names listed in the following section are used as the header names.",
      "source_hash": 16340106231332417695,
      "context_hash": 8797060149563338795,
      "translation": "다음 절에 나열된 필드 이름들이 헤더 이름으로 사용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:19.901984Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "There's no extension mechanism in this simple format; the Catalog and Distutils SIGs will aim at getting a more flexible format ready for Python 2.2.",
      "source_hash": 15936843624035444592,
      "context_hash": 6195998898659702865,
      "translation": "이 단순한 형식에는 확장 메커니즘이 없으며, Catalog 및 Distutils SIG는 Python 2.2를 위해 더 유연한 형식을 준비하는 것을 목표로 할 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:19.901984Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Fields",
      "source_hash": 8801550319744839382,
      "context_hash": 13554324887958701902,
      "translation": "필드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:19.901984Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This section specifies the names and semantics of each of the supported metadata fields.",
      "source_hash": 9609715058023728548,
      "context_hash": 10995584239740163911,
      "translation": "이 절은 지원되는 각 메타데이터 필드의 이름과 의미를 명시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:19.901985Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Fields marked with \"(Multiple use)\" may be specified multiple times in a single PKG-INFO file.",
      "source_hash": 13894589803829462265,
      "context_hash": 7578212817554930703,
      "translation": "\"(Multiple use)\"로 표시된 필드는 하나의 PKG-INFO 파일 안에서 여러 번 지정될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565915Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Other fields may only occur once in a PKG-INFO file.",
      "source_hash": 7059932366488618380,
      "context_hash": 11855411832807852808,
      "translation": "그 외의 필드는 PKG-INFO 파일 안에서 한 번만 나타날 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565918Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Fields marked with \"(optional)\" are not required to appear in a valid PKG-INFO file, all other fields must be present.",
      "source_hash": 8785804879070118935,
      "context_hash": 10020560256073434685,
      "translation": "\"(optional)\"로 표시된 필드는 유효한 PKG-INFO 파일에 반드시 나타날 필요는 없으며, 그 외의 모든 필드는 반드시 존재해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565918Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Metadata-Version",
      "source_hash": 17760411396601320070,
      "context_hash": 6100296093839696165,
      "translation": "Metadata-Version",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565919Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Version of the file format; currently \"1.0\" is the only legal value here.",
      "source_hash": 7504210942402453355,
      "context_hash": 17276435319459515173,
      "translation": "파일 형식의 버전으로, 현재 \"1.0\"만이 여기서 유효한 값입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565919Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 7694699729098611368,
      "translation": "예시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565919Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Name",
      "source_hash": 10960610182298152005,
      "context_hash": 10407503714764737625,
      "translation": "Name",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565920Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The name of the package.",
      "source_hash": 15148163999686467216,
      "context_hash": 3816371200488287256,
      "translation": "패키지의 이름입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565920Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 1569398457601460906,
      "translation": "예시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565920Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Version",
      "source_hash": 16904860506004502524,
      "context_hash": 10962229933684593768,
      "translation": "Version",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565920Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A string containing the package's version number.",
      "source_hash": 16652328162147224332,
      "context_hash": 16768564694699658738,
      "translation": "패키지의 버전 번호를 담은 문자열입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565921Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This field should be parseable by one of the Version classes (StrictVersion or LooseVersion) in the distutils.version module.",
      "source_hash": 9665887262816682611,
      "context_hash": 3325724800358037918,
      "translation": "이 필드는 distutils.version 모듈의 Version 클래스(StrictVersion 또는 LooseVersion) 중 하나로 파싱 가능해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565921Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 7128288497539031403,
      "translation": "예시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565921Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Platform (multiple use)",
      "source_hash": 1678610552865821649,
      "context_hash": 4961086621173430911,
      "translation": "Platform (multiple use)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565921Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A comma-separated list of platform specifications, summarizing the operating systems supported by the package.",
      "source_hash": 16825751882309349953,
      "context_hash": 5577975512845929381,
      "translation": "패키지가 지원하는 운영 체제를 요약한, 쉼표로 구분된 플랫폼 명세 목록입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565921Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The major supported platforms are listed below, but this list is necessarily incomplete.",
      "source_hash": 7304339104509684058,
      "context_hash": 9017316083442058153,
      "translation": "주요 지원 플랫폼은 아래에 나열되어 있으나, 이 목록이 반드시 완전한 것은 아닙니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:25.565922Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Binary distributions will use the Supported-Platform field in their metadata to specify the OS and CPU for which the binary package was compiled.",
      "source_hash": 2219668119038842223,
      "context_hash": 2114571308567528813,
      "translation": "바이너리 배포판은 메타데이터의 Supported-Platform 필드를 사용하여 바이너리 패키지가 컴파일된 OS와 CPU를 지정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795563Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The semantics of the Supported-Platform are not specified in this PEP.",
      "source_hash": 16745437245813790893,
      "context_hash": 3827713627431515289,
      "translation": "Supported-Platform의 의미는 이 PEP에서 규정하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795567Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 13199254287637149574,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795568Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Summary",
      "source_hash": 13527386753909660859,
      "context_hash": 13666806240138781209,
      "translation": "요약",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795568Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A one-line summary of what the package does.",
      "source_hash": 4153365739339257091,
      "context_hash": 4945466595076540074,
      "translation": "패키지가 수행하는 작업에 대한 한 줄 요약입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795569Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 11328950138328719764,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795569Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Description (optional)",
      "source_hash": 13197608734762524467,
      "context_hash": 1067624084552212859,
      "translation": "Description (선택 사항)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795569Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A longer description of the package that can run to several paragraphs.  (Software that deals with metadata should not assume any maximum size for this field, though one hopes that people won't include their instruction manual as the long-description.)",
      "source_hash": 8962097384203231810,
      "context_hash": 17606568448760902926,
      "translation": "여러 문단에 걸칠 수 있는 패키지에 대한 더 긴 설명입니다. (메타데이터를 다루는 소프트웨어는 이 필드의 최대 크기를 가정해서는 안 되지만, 사람들이 사용 설명서 전체를 long-description으로 넣지 않기를 바랍니다.)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795570Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 17381323164556718525,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795570Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Keywords (optional)",
      "source_hash": 6842684130894582344,
      "context_hash": 2981764443307984501,
      "translation": "Keywords (선택 사항)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795570Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A list of additional keywords to be used to assist searching for the package in a larger catalog.",
      "source_hash": 471457679325639513,
      "context_hash": 10739890973826967134,
      "translation": "더 큰 카탈로그에서 패키지를 검색하는 데 도움이 되는 추가 키워드 목록입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795571Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 15858616723889067155,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795571Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Home-page (optional)",
      "source_hash": 965275485764932668,
      "context_hash": 6381146031918500752,
      "translation": "Home-page (선택 사항)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A string containing the URL for the package's home page.",
      "source_hash": 12966032169709914936,
      "context_hash": 8374778977500019428,
      "translation": "패키지의 홈페이지 URL을 포함하는 문자열입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 6019529752444898715,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:12/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Author (optional)",
      "source_hash": 6283841809443455609,
      "context_hash": 6628524935311111516,
      "translation": "Author (선택 사항)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:15.795572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:12/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A string containing at a minimum the author's name.",
      "source_hash": 12036313857284910442,
      "context_hash": 11229922774037686767,
      "translation": "최소한 저자의 이름을 포함하는 문자열입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451139Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:12/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Contact information can also be added, separating each line with newlines.",
      "source_hash": 6122032314105079735,
      "context_hash": 14021640023890371062,
      "translation": "각 줄을 줄바꿈으로 구분하여 연락처 정보도 추가할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451142Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:12/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 3387357787542994610,
      "translation": "예",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451142Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Author-email",
      "source_hash": 13977117840397741417,
      "context_hash": 6865734556285038390,
      "translation": "Author-email",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451142Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A string containing the author's e-mail address.",
      "source_hash": 13856757529282767219,
      "context_hash": 1426634495180648898,
      "translation": "저자의 이메일 주소를 포함하는 문자열입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451143Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It can contain a name and e-mail address in the legal forms for a :rfc:`822` 'From:' header.",
      "source_hash": 3890972378984141112,
      "context_hash": 242484570402670605,
      "translation": "이 문자열은 :rfc:`822`\\ 의 'From:' 헤더에 사용되는 정식 형식으로 이름과 이메일 주소를 포함할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451143Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "It's not optional because cataloging systems can use the e-mail portion of this field as a unique key representing the author.",
      "source_hash": 5355057847075027332,
      "context_hash": 7470425530861400855,
      "translation": "카탈로그 시스템이 이 필드의 이메일 부분을 저자를 나타내는 고유 키로 사용할 수 있기 때문에, 이는 선택 사항이 아닙니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451143Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "A catalog might provide authors the ability to store their GPG key, personal home page, and other additional metadata *about the author*, and optionally the ability to associate several e-mail addresses with the same person.",
      "source_hash": 14376488732906891874,
      "context_hash": 9715525106518575494,
      "translation": "카탈로그는 저자에게 GPG 키, 개인 홈페이지, 그리고 *저자에 대한* 기타 추가 메타데이터를 저장하는 기능을 제공할 수 있으며, 선택적으로 여러 이메일 주소를 동일한 인물과 연결하는 기능도 제공할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451143Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:1/seg:4",
      "source": "Author-related metadata fields are not covered by this PEP.",
      "source_hash": 8444892709501467342,
      "context_hash": 1683055752456561722,
      "translation": "저자 관련 메타데이터 필드는 이 PEP에서 다루지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451144Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 8760860374019515193,
      "translation": "예",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451144Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "License",
      "source_hash": 7744803634010242306,
      "context_hash": 16803338550146262303,
      "translation": "License",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451144Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A string selected from a short list of choices, specifying the license covering the package.",
      "source_hash": 10711111574362745894,
      "context_hash": 7181783016996564885,
      "translation": "패키지를 포괄하는 라이선스를 지정하는, 짧은 선택지 목록에서 선택된 문자열입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451144Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Some licenses result in the software being freely redistributable, so packagers and resellers can automatically know that they're free to redistribute the software.",
      "source_hash": 7762289489803200102,
      "context_hash": 10940249164560217175,
      "translation": "일부 라이선스는 소프트웨어를 자유롭게 재배포할 수 있게 하여, 패키저와 재판매자가 소프트웨어를 자유롭게 재배포할 수 있다는 것을 자동으로 알 수 있게 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451144Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Other licenses will require a careful reading by a human to determine how the software can be repackaged and resold.",
      "source_hash": 16648308617622610381,
      "context_hash": 4554126850498209510,
      "translation": "다른 라이선스는 소프트웨어를 어떻게 재패키징하고 재판매할 수 있는지 결정하기 위해 사람이 주의 깊게 읽어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The choices are",
      "source_hash": 3648113656104998142,
      "context_hash": 16267037004212585796,
      "translation": "선택지는 다음과 같습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Definitions of some of the licenses are:",
      "source_hash": 12347373952360402741,
      "context_hash": 9606718100862673705,
      "translation": "일부 라이선스의 정의는 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:42.451145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "DFSG",
      "source_hash": 15522685591609068395,
      "context_hash": 415447758627748934,
      "translation": "DFSG",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189794Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "The license conforms to the Debian Free Software Guidelines, but does not use one of the other DFSG conforming licenses listed here.",
      "source_hash": 2897428995901272898,
      "context_hash": 2791677657912955817,
      "translation": "이 라이선스는 데비안 자유 소프트웨어 지침(Debian Free Software Guidelines)을 준수하지만, 여기에 나열된 다른 DFSG 준수 라이선스 중 하나를 사용하지는 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189800Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "More information is available at: http://www.debian.org/social_contract#guidelines",
      "source_hash": 2328464011678849296,
      "context_hash": 6828226948477893052,
      "translation": "자세한 정보는 http://www.debian.org/social_contract#guidelines 에서 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189804Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Python",
      "source_hash": 15947104486033060433,
      "context_hash": 5075165199046687046,
      "translation": "Python",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189805Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Python 1.6 or higher license.",
      "source_hash": 13675920411680433165,
      "context_hash": 1118747326001117590,
      "translation": "Python 1.6 이상 라이선스입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189807Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "Version 1.5.2 and earlier are under the MIT license.",
      "source_hash": 6983644363760956268,
      "context_hash": 658688027877235340,
      "translation": "버전 1.5.2 이하는 MIT 라이선스를 따릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189808Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "public domain",
      "source_hash": 12922356834711769037,
      "context_hash": 5303457494333954461,
      "translation": "public domain",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189809Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Software is public domain, not copyrighted.",
      "source_hash": 15449376944741034853,
      "context_hash": 14056192701834916426,
      "translation": "소프트웨어는 퍼블릭 도메인이며, 저작권이 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189810Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "unknown",
      "source_hash": 10671237351553527577,
      "context_hash": 2000894353846895509,
      "translation": "unknown",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189811Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Status is not known",
      "source_hash": 1529056025313180984,
      "context_hash": 14042333168074157085,
      "translation": "상태를 알 수 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189812Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "nocommercial",
      "source_hash": 7318393854417445238,
      "context_hash": 18263690084154714353,
      "translation": "nocommercial",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189813Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Free private use but commercial use not permitted",
      "source_hash": 2123880878255178936,
      "context_hash": 16643590920058648572,
      "translation": "개인적인 용도로는 자유롭게 사용할 수 있지만 상업적 용도는 허용되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189813Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "nosell",
      "source_hash": 12068252173514919275,
      "context_hash": 10261438146277892763,
      "translation": "nosell",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189814Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "Free use but distribution for profit by arrangement",
      "source_hash": 7088478739049209779,
      "context_hash": 5455875587015251991,
      "translation": "자유롭게 사용할 수 있지만 영리 목적의 배포는 별도 계약이 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189815Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "nosource",
      "source_hash": 17556731965497823219,
      "context_hash": 1450760855124113779,
      "translation": "nosource",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189815Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "Freely distributable but no source code",
      "source_hash": 12631751011276080528,
      "context_hash": 15557896062195356932,
      "translation": "자유롭게 배포할 수 있지만 소스 코드는 제공되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:09:16.189816Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:20/seg:0",
      "source": "shareware",
      "source_hash": 7011188020373873402,
      "context_hash": 16753953062679981727,
      "translation": "셰어웨어",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:56.789870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:21/seg:0",
      "source": "Payment is requested if software is used",
      "source_hash": 2228112202478557941,
      "context_hash": 3076249895338846775,
      "translation": "소프트웨어를 사용할 경우 대금을 지불해야 합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:56.789874Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:22/seg:0",
      "source": "other",
      "source_hash": 3469791424246342234,
      "context_hash": 14651266787912207305,
      "translation": "기타",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:56.789874Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:23/seg:0",
      "source": "General category for other non-DFSG licenses",
      "source_hash": 786802395441976450,
      "context_hash": 2730390808037864599,
      "translation": "기타 비-DFSG 라이선스를 위한 일반 범주입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:56.789874Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:24/seg:0",
      "source": "Some of these licenses can be interpreted to mean the software is freely redistributable.",
      "source_hash": 8394511323530615143,
      "context_hash": 2660937190952970239,
      "translation": "이 라이선스들 중 일부는 소프트웨어를 자유롭게 재배포할 수 있다는 의미로 해석될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:56.789875Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:24/seg:1",
      "source": "The list of redistributable licenses is",
      "source_hash": 13893449667393499528,
      "context_hash": 432816789387819117,
      "translation": "재배포 가능한 라이선스 목록은 다음과 같습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:56.789875Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:26/seg:0",
      "source": "Note that being redistributable does not mean a package qualifies as free software, 'nosource' and 'shareware' being examples.",
      "source_hash": 13654650498452288670,
      "context_hash": 5593564530709487374,
      "translation": "재배포 가능하다는 것이 패키지가 자유 소프트웨어로 인정됨을 의미하지는 않는다는 점에 유의하십시오. 'nosource'와 'shareware'가 그 예입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:56.789875Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:27/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 5170517542459203318,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:56.789875Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Acknowledgements",
      "source_hash": 16326275492144793040,
      "context_hash": 3121488751649354774,
      "translation": "감사의 말",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:56.789876Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Many changes and rewrites to this document were suggested by the readers of the Distutils SIG.",
      "source_hash": 10905851573028801817,
      "context_hash": 15722912232818908155,
      "translation": "이 문서에 대한 많은 변경과 재작성은 Distutils SIG 독자들의 제안에 따른 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:56.789876Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "In particular, Sean Reifschneider often contributed actual text for inclusion in this PEP.",
      "source_hash": 18325732882377177439,
      "context_hash": 4955030257937604567,
      "translation": "특히 Sean Reifschneider는 이 PEP에 포함될 실제 텍스트를 자주 제공했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:56.789876Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The list of licenses was compiled using the SourceForge license list and the CTAN license list compiled by Graham Williams; Carey Evans also offered several useful suggestions on this list.",
      "source_hash": 2022177102756457457,
      "context_hash": 12354985936098935543,
      "translation": "라이선스 목록은 SourceForge 라이선스 목록과 Graham Williams가 편집한 CTAN 라이선스 목록을 사용하여 작성되었습니다. Carey Evans 역시 이 목록에 대해 여러 유용한 제안을 해주었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:07:56.789877Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}